    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36412" root="قوس" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُسَوِىٌّ</span></b>  is the rel. n. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِسِىٌّ</span>, [pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْسٌ</span>,]
because it is [before its last change] of the
measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلُوعٌ</span> changed from the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُعُولٌ</span>.
(S.)

